.idea

# Vendored Helm dependencies — ArgoCD resolves these itself.
# Chart.lock stays out of git too: ArgoCD's `helm dependency build` fails hard
# on a lock file that drifted from Chart.yaml, and versions are already pinned.
infrastructure/*/charts/
infrastructure/*/Chart.lock
applications/*/charts/
applications/*/Chart.lock
*.tgz

# Filled-in credentials — only the .example.yaml belongs in git.
bootstrap/repo-credentials.yaml
*deploy-key*
!*deploy-key*.pub